>  H0: mean(diff) = 0                              Degrees of freedom =       33
> 
>  Ha: mean(diff) < 0           Ha: mean(diff) != 0           Ha: mean(diff) > 0
>  Pr(T < t) = 0.9877         Pr(|T| > |t|) = 0.0245          Pr(T > t) = 0.0123
